## How Cache Name Links to Config

```java
// Service class
@Cacheable(value = "deptStats", ...)   // uses deptStatsConfig → 1 hour
@Cacheable(value = "userCache", ...)   // uses userConfig → 5 min
@Cacheable(value = "products", ...)    // uses defaultConfig → 10 min
```

```
"deptStats" in @Cacheable
      ↓
RedisCacheManager looks up "deptStats"
      ↓
Finds deptStatsConfig → TTL 1 hour
      ↓
Stores in Redis with 1 hour expiry
```

