## Full Picture - What Sits in Redis

```bash
redis-cli KEYS *

# userCache keys (5 min TTL)
userCache::1
userCache::2

# deptStats keys (1 hour TTL)  
deptStats::Engineering-2024
deptStats::HR-2024

# products keys (10 min TTL - default)
products::101
products::102


redis-cli TTL userCache::1
# 287  ← seconds remaining (5 min)

redis-cli TTL deptStats::Engineering-2024
# 3547 ← seconds remaining (1 hour)
```

