## Additional Config Options You Can Add

```java
RedisCacheConfiguration config = RedisCacheConfiguration
    .defaultCacheConfig()
    .entryTtl(Duration.ofMinutes(10))

    // Disable null values (don't cache null results)
    .disableCachingNullValues()

    // Change key prefix
    // default: "cacheName::key"
    // custom:  "myapp:cacheName:key"
    .prefixCacheNameWith("myapp:")

    // Disable key prefix entirely
    .disableKeyPrefix()

    // Serialize keys as String
    .serializeKeysWith(
        RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair.fromSerializer(
            new StringRedisSerializer()
        )
    )

    // Serialize values as JSON
    .serializeValuesWith(
        RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair.fromSerializer(
            new GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer()
        )
    );
```

