## Summary

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| `defaultCacheConfig()` | Start with default settings |
| `entryTtl()` | Set expiry time for keys |
| `serializeValuesWith()` | How to convert Java object to Redis storage |
| `cacheDefaults()` | Apply config to all caches |
| `withCacheConfiguration()` | Override config for specific cache |
| `disableCachingNullValues()` | Don't store null in Redis |
| `prefixCacheNameWith()` | Custom prefix for all keys |
| `build()` | Create final CacheManager |

